@startuml
title Communication diagram: fan-out при построении AST

skinparam shadowing false

object ":ParseCoordinatorActor" as Coord
object ":SubtreeBuilderWorker_1" as W1
object ":SubtreeBuilderWorker_2" as W2
object ":SubtreeBuilderWorker_N" as WN
object ":ParseResultCollectorActor" as Collector

Coord --> W1 : 1: BuildSubtreeRequest(node_1)
Coord --> W2 : 2: BuildSubtreeRequest(node_2)
Coord --> WN : 3: BuildSubtreeRequest(node_N)

W1 --> Coord : 1.1: SubtreeCompleted(node_1, subtree_1)
W2 --> Coord : 2.1: SubtreeCompleted(node_2, subtree_2)
WN --> Coord : 3.1: SubtreeCompleted(node_N, subtree_N)

Coord --> Collector : 4: ParseCompleted(AstDocument)

note right of Coord
  Нумерация показывает партнёрство сообщений
  (request / response), а не строгий временной
  порядок — последовательность см.
  sequence/fanout_sequence.puml.
end note

@enduml
